review_comments.body:
**Silent discard of `io.ReadAll` error.** If reading the response body fails (connection reset, partial read during shutdown), the error is dropped with `_`. The subsequent error message at line 208 may contain a truncated or empty body, making debugging harder.

Suggest capturing the error:
```go
respBody, err := io.ReadAll(resp.Body)
if err != nil {
    return ret.Errorf(errorcode.ErrorCode_ExecCommandInSandboxFailed,
        "envd init: read response body: %v", err)
}
```

