review_comments.body:
**Suggestion:** The error from `jsoniter.Marshal` is silently discarded here. If marshaling fails (e.g., a non-serializable field is introduced in `VirtiofsConfig` in the future), `vc` will be nil and an empty/broken annotation value will be set on the container. Consider checking the error:

```go
vc, err := jsoniter.Marshal(virtiofsConfig)
if err != nil {
    return nil, ret.Errorf(errorcode.ErrorCode_InvalidParamFormat, "marshal virtiofs config failed: %w", err)
}
```

This pattern appears in a few other places in the codebase — addressing it here would set a good example.

